# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values.
# List the NAMES of the vars a tool needs in that tool's manifest "env": [...].
# .env values are injected into the tool's process environment at run time;
# they are NEVER returned through MCP (tools.search reports names only).
# A var set empty here is REMOVED from the child's environment.
#
